<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch NBM, Saint-Gobain finalise Filamat takeover.</title>
<headline>Dutch NBM, Saint-Gobain finalise Filamat takeover.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Units of Dutch NBM-Amstelland NV and of France's Saint-Gobain said on Thursday they had finalised the takeover of Filamat of the Netherlands.  </p>
<p>No financial details were disclosed but NBM Amstelland said its profits for 1996 would not be affected by the deal.</p>
<p>Cementbouw Beheer Beheer BV, a unit of NBM-Amstelland and MCI, a unit of glassmaker Saint-Gobain, have signed an agreement on the planned takeover, which was announced on September 23.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
